ted to labeled metal ports on a high-speed communication interface panel.","srcset":["/assets/images/bluetest-edited-052-p-500.webp 500w","/assets/images/bluetest-edited-052-p-800.webp 800w","/assets/images/bluetest-edited-052-p-1080.webp 1080w","/assets/images/bluetest-edited-052-p-1600.webp 1600w","/assets/images/bluetest-edited-052-p-2000.webp 2000w","/assets/images/bluetest-edited-052-p-2600.webp 2600w","/assets/images/bluetest-edited-052-p-3200.webp 3200w","/assets/images/bluetest-edited-052.webp 3239w"],"sizes":"(max-width: 1919px) 100vw, 1620px"},"in38b8d9ca":{"src":"/assets/images/hero.webp","alt":"","sizes":""},"i4d206742":{"src":"/assets/images/inbug-black.png","alt":"","srcset":["/assets/images/inbug-black-p-500.png 500w","/assets/images/inbug-black.png 840w"],"sizes":"(max-width: 840px) 100vw, 840px"},"i55b1d33b":{"src":"/assets/images/instagram_glyph_black.svg","alt":"","sizes":""},"in83b9d6d":{"src":"/assets/images/facebook-svgrepo-com.svg","alt":"","sizes":""},"i37ad5373":{"src":"/assets/images/403735439_e670a3bc-a2f0-42bf-8f59-92e7f41f4077.svg","alt":"","sizes":""},"in33bb037c":{"src":"/assets/images/youtube.png","alt":"","sizes":""},"in4a40e5b7":{"src":"/assets/images/vector-36.svg","alt":"","sizes":""}},"link":{"a2f":"/","a-3ca85cd0":"accessories","a30012e":"flow","a6084ccde":"about-us","af54e711":"sector/medical-technology","a62655c97":"sector/defense","a5621714b":"sector/iot-wlan-bluetooth","a-5bffa1fd":"sector/telecommunication","a-6999a2c2":"sector/automotive","a63dd000":"newss","a-1ef6e313":"technologyy","a2104e8b5":"careers","a7c33cc01":"https://customerweb.bluetest.se/customerweb/login/","a38b72420":"contact","a23":"#","a37ee57a2":"tel:+46317786161","a-2a20e0a8":"mailto:sales@bluetest.se","a-3e222e29":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/bluetest-ab/","a2940ef2b":"https://www.instagram.com/bluetest_ab/","a661946fd":"https://www.facebook.com/bluetestab","a-ed46480":"https://x.com/BluetestAB","a-150b0672":"https://www.youtube.com/@BluetestAB","a2eb955bb":"about-us#adress","a48d7b347":"contact#form","a-1db89ce9":"privacy-policy","a3e9d8061":"environmental-policy"},"text":{"t2268ff":"Home","tn37f9ca7c":"Products","tn7a5fd008":"Our Products","t592afcb5":"Chambers","t26c14b10":"Accessories","tn1fab0f1e":"Bluetest Flow","t645f0031":"About us","tn2757d253":"Sectors","tn4b05f9b3":"Main business areas","tn758e945c":"Healthcare &amp; Medical","t3d2aa41a":"Defense &amp; Security","tn3c25ad95":"IoT Devices","te063d77":"Telecom","tn73e4c4eb":"Automotive","t74af045":"News /&nbsp;Press","t12b9612c":"Technology","t77e0f39e":"Career","t462ff49":"Login","t7f2746de":"Contact Us","tn19111e0f":"Acessories","t1e8b207":"RBS test suite","tn4ceb698b":"Compact, powerful our smallest chamber to date","t54fa3c0a":"Defence &amp; Security","t2cdea0c5":"News / Press","t385bf5da":"Connectivity that works everywhere","t2a75535f":"About Bluetest","tn27fa89c1":"Defense engagement","t7f274abe":"Contact us","t5b53a607":"Supporting mission-critical reliability","t44b17b59":"Innovative solutions for the defense industry.","tnd32bd50":"Technologies:","t4aaf454":"RTS25","t4aaf4d0":"RTS65","t4aaf50e":"RTS85","t4aaf52d":"RTS95","t785928cc":"Dual-chamber solution","t4891f34e":"Bluetest AB delivers cutting-edge dual-chamber solutions that enable realistic, repeatable testing of drone communication systems under challenging RF conditions. With interconnected reverberation chambers, engineers can evaluate command, control, and video links exactly as they behave in the field without modifying the drone.","tn5230a9d2":"Get in touch","tn3ea16e27":"Live Person Testing","t363b97eb":"Body phantoms enable standardized, repeatable RF tests but miss real-world human variation, so live-person measurements in large chambers like RTS95 reveal person-to-person effects (often linked to body size) on TRP/TIS while still remaining highly repeatable.","tn6302c36e":"Tomorrow's testing, today. Contact us.","t4a42e442":"News &amp;&nbsp;Research","tn17655669":"More news &amp;&nbsp;research","tn42d4c927":"Partners &amp; Clients","tn64202ba3":"Company","t1ed033d4":"Address","t432ef84d":"+46 31 778 6161","t43c65a60":"sales@bluetest.se","t3eb4f971":"Social Media","tn1a2819cc":"Navigation","t645efc51":"About Us","tn530b3473":"Healthcare","tn40b1d9e0":"Defense","tn4b8f3e15":"IoT&nbsp;Devices","tn7bc27f6b":"Careers","tn64104400":"Contact","t35c884dc":"Subscribe to our newsletter","tn6329b7f0":"Keep up on our always evolving product features and technology. Enter your e-mail and subscribe to our newsletter.","t5a0ea5a1":"Thank you! Your submission has been received!","tn7c112e99":"Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.","tn3fbde6f6":"Privacy Policy","t64169e54":"Environmental Policy"},"textarea":{"tan3b32366d":"Bluetest supports the defense sector with advanced OTA testing that ensures robust and reliable communication in mission-critical environments. Our systems make it possible to validate the performance of radios, sensors, and integrated platforms under controlled and fully repeatable conditions.<br><br>By accurately measuring antenna behavior, interference sensitivity, and signal stability, development teams can identify risks early and optimize solutions long before field deployment.","ta75de84c1":"By combining scalable chamber solutions with high measurement accuracy, Bluetest helps defense suppliers and military organizations reduce testing costs and shorten development cycles. Our technology enables secure, repeatable, and classification-friendly testing of wireless equipment: everything from soldier-worn systems to vehicles, drones, and tactical networks.<br><br>The result is faster innovation, stronger decision-making, and higher reliability across mission-critical communication systems.","tan61d0925a":"Bluetest is a pioneer in wireless test solutions through innovative application of the reverberation chamber technology.<br><br>Read more <a href=\"about-us\">about us.</a>\n                    ","tan502daf24":"<strong>Lindholmsallén 10</strong>,<br>SE-417 55 Göteborg, Sweden"},"richtext":{},"iframe":{}}